{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18820","headline":"和郴州杨侍郎翫郡斋紫薇花十四韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"和郴州杨侍郎翫郡斋紫薇花十四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几年丹霄上，出入金华省。\n暂别万年枝，看花桂阳岭。\n南方足奇树，公府成佳境。\n绿阴交广除，明艳透萧屏。\n雨余人吏散，燕语帘栊静。\n懿此含晓芳，翛然忘簿领。\n紫茸垂组缕，金[缕]攒锋頴。\n露溽暗传香，风轻徐就影。\n苒弱多意思，从容占光景。\n得地在侯家，移根近仙井。\n开尊好凝睇，倚瑟仍回颈。\n游蜂驻彩冠，舞鹤迷烟顶。\n兴生红药後，爱与甘棠并。\n不学夭桃姿，浮荣在俄顷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}